      "statement": "Constructor owns bounded implementation/self-review. Required independent assessment evaluates exact live realization, computational binding, authority paths, proof and installed subject; constructor summaries are insufficient. Shared independence binds actors without an actor-count prescription. Governing authority declares whether a proxy can accept/advance routine actions: it may accept preservation, require local repair, reject violations and advance already-authorized work, but cannot change Product meaning, requirements, authority or accepted design; such changes re-enter owners. Accepted basis/cone/decision envelope/re-entry conditions remove a need for human ceremony at every transition. A capable context with sufficient work authority, exact intake and operation grant may enter directly as constructor/Writer without Executive appointment; coordination depends on material contexts/authority/capability/independence, not names. Direct entry preserves execution-contract admission, smallest lawful carrier, assessment and reserved decisions, not self-acceptance. One grant may cover declared construction/status/checkpoint sequence; record actual role transitions in existing carrier, with no new grant or unchanged-subject rehash solely for status. Material operation/subject/territory/authority/validity changes require resolved bindings before effect. Executive mutation restrictions still apply.",
